You can use JavaScript along with CSS to create a button that toggles dark mode and remembers the choice after refresh. Here's a simple example:

HTML:
```html
<button id="toggleButton">Toggle Dark Mode</button>
```

CSS:
```css
body {
  background-color: #ffffff;
  color: #000000;
}

#toggleButton {
  background-color: #000000;
  color: #ffffff;
  cursor: pointer;
}
```

